      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd like to see a full-block mode and half-block mode where in the latter, you can know where the other player is at least. And when you \"click\" on them, you will just get a text saying the general rules of VRChat interactions and to prevent drama and such.\n\nAnd the full-block will automatically turn into half-block after a year or so.\n\nSo in the case of people forgiving eachother, they at least can know the blocked person is there and can unblock them if they wanted.\n\nThe person who blocked you can still see the name or put full-block back on if they desire.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
