      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with most of this thread. Maybe for those who truly want no contact, some customization options could prove useful. \n\nI really appreciate the idea that further harassment observed by a blocked user who is crossing a clear boundary of being blocked already, could lead to decisive bans.",
